# The Deploy to Cloudflare button prompts for exactly the names listed here.
# Everything else (WhatsApp connection, staff, settings) is entered in the app at /setup and Settings.

# Signs sessions and encrypts the saved WhatsApp connection. Also the one-time key you type on /setup.
# 32+ random characters, for example:  openssl rand -hex 32
# Keep a copy: changing it later makes the saved WhatsApp connection unreadable until it is saved again.
SESSION_SECRET=
